# 120100 is live Mainline; 120105 is Mainline Test (the PTR). Both are listed so
# the addon loads on either without a second TOC -- comma-delimited interface
# versions have been supported since 10.2.7.
## Interface: 120100, 120105
## Title: PetWatch
## Notes: Shows an indicator when your hunter pet is missing or dead.
## Notes-deDE: Zeigt eine Anzeige, wenn dein Jägerbegleiter fehlt oder tot ist.
## Author: Aybee2k8
# A literal version, not the packager's @project-version@ placeholder: that is
# only substituted when a release is built, so a clone or ZIP install would show
# the placeholder itself in the addon list. Bump this with the release tag --
# the release workflow refuses a tag that does not match.
## Version: 0.1.0
## SavedVariables: PetWatchDB
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Hunter_BeastTaming
# The unlocalized fallback goes first: later entries overwrite earlier ones, so
# a locale with no entry of its own still lands in a sensible category.
## Category: Combat
## Category-deDE: Kampf
## AddonCompartmentFunc: PetWatch_OnAddonCompartmentClick

